msgid ""
"In the fields\n"
"    Copy to dir\n"
"    Planned name\n"
"    Copy with name\n"
"the following macros are processed.     (If path is 'p1/p2/p3/stem.ext')\n"
"    {FILE_DIR}            -             ('p1/p2/p3')\n"
"    {FILE_NAME}           -             ('stem.ext')\n"
"    {FILE_STEM}           -             ('stem')\n"
"    {FILE_EXT}            -             ('ext')\n"
"    {YY} {YYYY}           - Year    as  '17' or '2017'\n"
"    {M} {MM} {MMM} {MMMM} - Month   as  '7' or '07' or 'jul' or 'July'\n"
"    {D} {DD}              - Day     as  '7' or '07'\n"
"    {h} {hh}              - Hours   as  '7' or '07' \n"
"    {m} {mm}              - Minutes as  '7' or '07' \n"
"    {s} {ss}              - Seconds as  '7' or '07' \n"
"    {COUNTER}             - Auto-incremented number\n"
"    {APP_DIR}             - CudaText folder path\n"
"    {APP_DRIVE}           - CudaText drive/disk letter (Windows only)\n"
" \n"
"Filters. \n"
"All macros can include suffix (function) to transform value.\n"
"   {Data|fun}             - gets fun({Data})\n"
"   {Data|fun:p1,p2}       - gets fun({Data},p1,p2)\n"
"   {Data|f1st:p1,p2|f2nd} - gets f2nd(f1st({Data},p1,p2))\n"
"Predefined filters are:\n"
"    p    - parent for path\n"
"    p:N  - N-parent for path (\"p\" is same as \"p:1\")\n"
"    name - last segment in path\n"
"    u    - upper: \"word\"  -> \"WORD\"\n"
"    l    - lower: \"WORD\"  -> \"word\"\n"
"    t    - title: \"he is\" -> \"He Is\"\n"
"    Examples: If path is     'head/p1/p2/p3/stem.ext'\n"
"        {FILE_DIR}        -> 'head/p1/p2/p3'\n"
"        {FILE_DIR|p}      -> 'head/p1/p2'\n"
"        {FILE_DIR|p|name} -> 'p2'\n"
"        {FILE_DIR|p:2}    -> 'head/p1'\n"
"        {FILE_EXT|u}      -> 'EXT'\n"
"        {FILE_EXT|t}      -> 'Ext'\n"
"Predefined filters for {COUNTER} are:\n"
"    w:N   - set width for value\n"
"    lim:N - set maximum value\n"
"    Examples: \n"
"        {COUNTER}           -> 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4 -> 5 -> …\n"
"        {COUNTER|w:3}       -> 001 -> 002 -> 003 -> …\n"
"        {COUNTER|lim:3}     -> 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 1 -> 2 -> …\n"
"        {COUNTER|lim:3|w:2} -> 01 -> 02 -> 03 -> 01 -> …\n"
msgstr ""
"以下のフィールドでは:\n"
"    保存先フォルダー\n"
"    予定ファイル名\n"
"    ファイル名形式\n"
"次のマクロが使用できます。           (パスが 'p1/p2/p3/stem.ext' の場合)\n"
"    {FILE_DIR}            -             ('p1/p2/p3')\n"
"    {FILE_NAME}           -             ('stem.ext')\n"
"    {FILE_STEM}           -             ('stem')\n"
"    {FILE_EXT}            -             ('ext')\n"
"    {YY} {YYYY}           - 年       '17' や '2017'\n"
"    {M} {MM} {MMM} {MMMM} - 月       '7', '07', 'jul', 'July'\n"
"    {D} {DD}              - 日       '7' や '07'\n"
"    {h} {hh}              - 時       '7' や '07' \n"
"    {m} {mm}              - 分       '7' や '07' \n"
"    {s} {ss}              - 秒       '7' や '07' \n"
"    {COUNTER}             - 自動インクリメント数値\n"
"    {APP_DIR}             - CudaText のフォルダーパス\n"
"    {APP_DRIVE}           - CudaText のドライブレター (Windows のみ)\n"
" \n"
"フィルター:\n"
"すべてのマクロは値を変換するためのサフィックス(関数)を含めることができま"
"す。\n"
"   {Data|fun}             - fun({Data}) を取得\n"
"   {Data|fun:p1,p2}       - fun({Data},p1,p2) を取得\n"
"   {Data|f1st:p1,p2|f2nd} - f2nd(f1st({Data},p1,p2)) を取得\n"
"定義済みのフィルター:\n"
"    p    - 親フォルダーパス\n"
"    p:N  - N 階層上の親フォルダー (\"p\" は \"p:1\" と同じ)\n"
"    name - パスの最後のセグメント\n"
"    u    - 大文字化: \"word\"  -> \"WORD\"\n"
"    l    - 小文字化: \"WORD\"  -> \"word\"\n"
"    t    - 単語の先頭を大文字化: \"he is\" -> \"He Is\"\n"
"    例: パスが 'head/p1/p2/p3/stem.ext' の場合\n"
"        {FILE_DIR}        -> 'head/p1/p2/p3'\n"
"        {FILE_DIR|p}      -> 'head/p1/p2'\n"
"        {FILE_DIR|p|name} -> 'p2'\n"
"        {FILE_DIR|p:2}    -> 'head/p1'\n"
"        {FILE_EXT|u}      -> 'EXT'\n"
"        {FILE_EXT|t}      -> 'Ext'\n"
" {COUNTER} 用の定義済みフィルター:\n"
"    w:N   - 桁数を指定 (ゼロ埋め)\n"
"    lim:N - 最大値を指定 (上限に達すると 1 にリセット)\n"
"    例: \n"
"        {COUNTER}           -> 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4 -> 5 -> …\n"
"        {COUNTER|w:3}       -> 001 -> 002 -> 003 -> …\n"
"        {COUNTER|lim:3}     -> 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 1 -> 2 -> …\n"
"        {COUNTER|lim:3|w:2} -> 01 -> 02 -> 03 -> 01 -> …\n"

